    "body": "![MOD LOGO](https://i.imgur.com/rxfLjS0.png)\n\n\nCollection of shared code for OctoStudios' mods. List of currently implemented features:\n- Datapack-like YAML-based config with auto-validation, deep searialization and other safety features.\n\n\n**NOTE:**\n- From 1.20.1 to 1.21.11 requires [**ArchitecturyAPI**](https://modrinth.com/mod/architectury-api) to work!\n\n\nIt's not recommended to use this mod if you're a mod developer, since codebase of this API may change a lot sometimes, but you still can do so if you want~\n\n\n***\n![MOD ART](https://i.imgur.com/7Thcq1K.png)\n***\n**WANT TO TRY OUT OUR OTHER MODS? - VISIT OCTO-STUDIOS.COM FOR MORE INFO!**",
